course: dictionary
lesson: 9521
title: A sad word with care: stillbirth
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words are sad, and grown-ups use them carefully. Stillbirth is one of them. Its two parts can help you: still and birth. A stillbirth is when a baby has died before it is born, late in the mother's pregnancy, so the baby is born not alive.
explain: «"Pregnancy loss" is the official phrase for a miscarriage or a stillbirth.» Both are kinds of pregnancy loss. A miscarriage happens earlier in pregnancy, and a stillbirth happens later, close to the time of birth. Read the words around the word to see which one the text means.
explain: You will meet this word in health lessons, in the news and in family talk. People often say it gently, because it is about grief and loss in a family. If you read it or hear it and feel unsure, you can ask a grown-up to explain.
fact: A stillbirth is when a baby has died before it is born, late in pregnancy.
fact: A stillborn baby is one that was born not alive. Stillborn is an adjective, a word that describes a noun.
fact: A miscarriage is when a baby is lost earlier in pregnancy.
fact: «Pregnancy loss» is the official phrase that covers both a miscarriage and a stillbirth.
fact: People speak about stillbirth gently, because it brings grief to a family. It is fine to ask a grown-up if you want to know more.
exercise: «"Pregnancy loss" is the official phrase for a miscarriage or a stillbirth.» What is a stillbirth? | A baby that dies a long time after it is born | *A baby that has died before it is born, late in pregnancy | A baby that cries loudly when it is born | A twin who is poorly
exercise: Which word means a baby lost earlier in pregnancy? | Lullaby | Stillbirth | *Miscarriage | Birthday
exercise: Which word describes a baby that was born not alive? | Miscarriage | *Stillborn | Pregnancy | Stillbirth
test: A stillbirth happens when a baby dies before it is born. When does this happen? | Early in the first week of pregnancy | *Late in the mother's pregnancy | At school | After the baby has grown up
test: Which phrase is the official name that covers both a miscarriage and a stillbirth? | Baby shower | *Pregnancy loss | Happy news | Lost teeth
exam: Read this: «Pregnancy loss is the official phrase for a miscarriage or a stillbirth.» Which word means a baby that has died before it is born, late in pregnancy? | Lullaby | Miscarriage | Birthday | *Stillbirth
